{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14526","headline":"赠史开府 · 戴叔伦","name":"赠史开府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南天胡马独悲嘶，白首相逢话鼓鼙。\n野战频年沙朔外，旌竿高与雪峰齐。\n扁舟远泛轻全楚，落日愁看旧紫泥。\n早晚瑶阶归伏奏，独能画地取关西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}